d first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t\t\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[<p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tesla-Showroom-Interest-March-2026-Riz-Akhtar-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tesla-Showroom-Interest-March-2026-Riz-Akhtar-150x150.jpg 150w, https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tesla-Showroom-Interest-March-2026-Riz-Akhtar-600x600.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />Tesla is offering up to $4,860 off selected in-stock Model 3s in Australia, with discounts of up to $3,450 on selected Model Ys.</p>\n<p>The post Tesla cuts up to $4,860 off in-stock Model 3s in Australia appeared first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t\t\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[<p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Tesla-Supercharger-Goulburn-Open-August-2025-Tesla-Charging-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Tesla-Supercharger-Goulburn-Open-August-2025-Tesla-Charging-150x150.jpg 150w, https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Tesla-Supercharger-Goulburn-Open-August-2025-Tesla-Charging-600x600.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />Tesla’s Goulburn Supercharger is once again Australia’s largest EV fast-charging site, with 28 bays offering up to 300 kW each.</p>\n<p>The post Tesla Goulburn Supercharger expands to 28 bays, becoming Australia’s largest appeared first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t\t\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[<p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Desert-Experience-F4Films-10-1-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image