an 70 GWh in supply deals appeared first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t\t\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[<p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/E-HS9_01-150x150.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"HongQi E-HS9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/E-HS9_01-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/E-HS9_01-600x600.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />Chinese luxury EV brand Hongqi has launched in Australia with a massive six-seat electric SUV, ambitious sales targets and even an electric ute under consideration.</p>\n<p>The post Chinese luxury EV brand Hongqi launches in Australia with massive six-seat electric SUV appeared first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t\t\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[<p><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Original-1233-electrify-commercial-costco-12-10-2024-1-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Original-1233-electrify-commercial-costco-12-10-2024-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Original-1233-electrify-commercial-costco-12-10-2024-1-600x600.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />EV sales may be slowing in the US, but that doesn't necessarily mean Americans are losing interest. Limited supply, high prices and government policy are making it harder for buyers to make the switch.</p>\n<p>The post Americans want electric cars – they just can’t find them appeared first on The Driven.</p>\n]]></description>\n\t\t\n--\n\t<description>Your best source for electric vehicle news &#38; analysis.</description>\n\t<lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:40:49 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n\t<lan