{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QZkBbibwLyi4hHsAhc2Cdn","type":"tool_result","content":"# MGU9 EV Variants\n\nThe page shows **one variant**, listed as \"MG MGU9 EV EV.\"\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Price** | Not stated. The page only links to \"Build & Price.\" |\n| **Battery** | \"102.2kWh LFP.\" It doesn't say whether this is gross or usable. Body copy rounds it to \"102kWh ultra-safe LFP battery.\" |\n| **WLTP range** | \"Up to 430km\" |\n| **Peak DC** | \"115kW peak DC\" |\n| **AC** | \"11kW AC three-phase\" |\n| **Fast-charge claim** | \"20-80% in 42 minutes.\" No 10-80% figure is given. |\n| **Body type** | \"Dual-Cab Ute\" |\n| **Seats** | Not stated |\n| **Drivetrain** | \"4x4,\" described as dual-motor AWD, \"125 + 200 kW (Front + Rear)\" and \"250 + 450 Nm (Front + Rear),\" for 325kW / 700Nm combined |\n\n**Other figures:** 0-100km/h is \"Up to 5.8s.\" Braked towing is 3,500kg, unbraked is 750kg, and payload is 685kg. Wheels are \"20\" Alloy 275/55 R20.\" The frunk holds 236L.\n\n**Availability:** Yes, the page says \"Available Now.\"\n\n**Inconsistencies on the page:**\n- The battery is given as both 102.2kWh and 102kWh.\n- One section says \"seven drive modes,\" while another says \"6 Drive Modes.\"\n- The disclaimer says data is correct \"as at October 2026,\" which looks odd for a page copyrighted 2026."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"91dcd24c-7db7-46e4-a1ac-a1a58bc44b26","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:15:44.719Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":456373,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# MGU9 EV Variants\n\nThe page shows **one variant**, listed as \"MG MGU9 EV EV.\"\n\n| Field | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Price** | Not stated. The page only links to \"Build & Price.\" |\n| **Battery** | \"102.2kWh LFP.\" It doesn't say whether this is gross or usable. Body copy rounds it to \"102kWh ultra-safe LFP battery.\" |\n| **WLTP range** | \"Up to 430km\" |\n| **Peak DC** | \"115kW peak DC\" |\n| **AC** | \"11kW AC three-phase\" |\n| **Fast-charge claim** | \"20-80% in 42 minutes.\" No 10-80% figure is given. |\n| **Body type** | \"Dual-Cab Ute\" |\n| **Seats** | Not stated |\n| **Drivetrain** | \"4x4,\" described as dual-motor AWD, \"125 + 200 kW (Front + Rear)\" and \"250 + 450 Nm (Front + Rear),\" for 325kW / 700Nm combined |\n\n**Other figures:** 0-100km/h is \"Up to 5.8s.\" Braked towing is 3,500kg, unbraked is 750kg, and payload is 685kg. Wheels are \"20\" Alloy 275/55 R20.\" The frunk holds 236L.\n\n**Availability:** Yes, the page says \"Available Now.\"\n\n**Inconsistencies on the page:**\n- The battery is given as both 102.2kWh and 102kWh.\n- One section says \"seven drive modes,\" while another says \"6 Drive Modes.\"\n- The disclaimer says data is correct \"as at October 2026,\" which looks odd for a page copyrighted 2026.","durationMs":10015,"url":"https://www.mgmotor.com.au/vehicles/mgu9-ev"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QZkBbibwLyi4hHsAhc2Cdn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012BnpqX8VBPtvfRQzCfVuFu","type":"tool_result","content":"**DEEPAL E07 Variants**\n\n**1. E07 RWD**\n- **Price:** \"From XX,XXX RDP\" and \"From XX,XXX MLP\" are placeholders. The variant card reads \"From: Recommended Driveaway Price\" with no figure.\n- **Battery:** \"89.98kWh NMC battery\". The page lists this once as a shared spec, not per variant.\n- **WLTP range:** \"550kms\"\n- **Peak DC:** \"240kW\"\n- **AC:** \"7kW AC charging\", with a full charge \"in about 16 hours\"\n- **Fast charge claim:** \"30 to 80% in just 15 minutes\" at 240kW\n- **Drivetrain:** Rear-wheel drive, \"single-motor\" with \"252kW and 365Nm\"\n\n**2. E07 AWD Performance**\n- **Price:** Same placeholder and wording as the RWD, with no figure.\n- **Battery:** The shared \"89.98kWh\" spec. No separate figure is given.\n- **WLTP range:** \"510kms\"\n- **Peak DC:** \"240kW\"\n- **AC:** \"7kW\", about 16 hours. This is stated once for the model, not per variant.\n- **Fast charge claim:** \"DC Charge Time 30%-80%: 15 minutes\"\n- **Drivetrain:** All-wheel drive, \"dual-motor\" with \"440kW, 645Nm\"\n- **Note:** The 0–100 km/h time is inconsistent. The spec list says \"3.9 seconds\" but the body text says \"3.96-second.\"\n\n**Is a dollar price shown?**\nNo vehicle price appears. The pricing tool needs a postcode and shows only \"XX,XXX\" placeholders. The only dollar amount on the page is the premium paint option, quoted as \"$800 excluding GST and government and statutory charges.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"840e901a-d7ae-4f93-8edd-22c0099d7684","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:15:45.690Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":230934,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**DEEPAL E07 Variants**\n\n**1. E07 RWD**\n- **Price:** \"From XX,XXX RDP\" and \"From XX,XXX MLP\" are placeholders. The variant card reads \"From: Recommended Driveaway Price\" with no figure.\n- **Battery:** \"89.98kWh NMC battery\". The page lists this once as a shared spec, not per variant.\n- **WLTP range:** \"550kms\"\n- **Peak DC:** \"240kW\"\n- **AC:** \"7kW AC charging\", with a full charge \"in about 16 hours\"\n- **Fast charge claim:** \"30 to 80% in just 15 minutes\" at 240kW\n- **Drivetrain:** Rear-wheel drive, \"single-motor\" with \"252kW and 365Nm\"\n\n**2. E07 AWD Performance**\n- **Price:** Same placeholder and wording as the RWD, with no figure.\n- **Battery:** The shared \"89.98kWh\" spec. No separate figure is given.\n- **WLTP range:** \"510kms\"\n- **Peak DC:** \"240kW\"\n- **AC:** \"7kW\", about 16 hours. This is stated once for the model, not per variant.\n- **Fast charge claim:** \"DC Charge Time 30%-80%: 15 minutes\"\n- **Drivetrain:** All-wheel drive, \"dual-motor\" with \"440kW, 645Nm\"\n- **Note:** The 0–100 km/h time is inconsistent. The spec list says \"3.9 seconds\" but the body text says \"3.96-second.\"\n\n**Is a dollar price shown?**\nNo vehicle price appears. The pricing tool needs a postcode and shows only \"XX,XXX\" placeholders. The only dollar amount on the page is the premium paint option, quoted as \"$800 excluding GST and government and statutory charges.\"","durationMs":9928,"url":"https://www.deepal.com.au/vehicles/deepal/e07/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012BnpqX8VBPtvfRQzCfVuFu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
