{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014SZFdxnXSPyWEcCk8d9zHc","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Deepal E07 Australia price drive-away announced\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"2026 Deepal E07 Australia: Price, Specs and Range - evee AU - Electric Car Rental\",\"url\":\"https://www.evee.com.au/blog/2026-deepal-e07-australia-price-specs-and-range/\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal E07 Price, Specs & Variants\",\"url\":\"https://thebeep.com.au/cars/deepal/e07\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Deepal E07 Price, Specs and Range\",\"url\":\"https://www.cartell.tv/cars/deepal/e07\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal E07 multitruck price revealed| Australia launch in Q3 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.cars24.com.au/car-news/deepal-reveals-australian-pricing-for-e07-q3-2025/\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal E07 2026 Pricing & Specifications - carsales\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/research/deepal/e07/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Deepal E07 Performance Auto AWD MY25 $77,704 - Cricks Highway\",\"url\":\"https://www.crickshighway.com.au/stock/details/OAG-AD-26225910/2026-deepal-e07-new\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Deepal E07 Performance Auto AWD MY25 $77,704 - Cricks Highway\",\"url\":\"https://www.crickshighway.com.au/stock/details/OAG-AD-26225849/2026-deepal-e07-new\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal E07 cars for sale in Australia - carsales.com.au\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/cars/deepal/e07/\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal Cars Australia\",\"url\":\"https://thebeep.com.au/cars/deepal/\"},{\"title\":\"Deepal E07 Electric cars for sale in Australia - carsales.com.au\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/cars/deepal/e07/electric-fueltype/\"}]\n\nThe Deepal E07 has two versions in Australia. Before on-road costs, the RWD is $64,900 and the AWD Performance is $73,900. Drive-away prices are roughly $68,000–72,000 for the RWD and $77,000–81,000 for the AWD, depending on the state.\n\n**Launch pricing:** The E07 was unveiled at the 2025 Melbourne Motor Show. At that time Deepal gave the E07 RWD at $64,900 before on-road costs, about $70,000 drive-away, and the E07 AWD at $73,900, about $80,000 drive-away. It was due to launch in Australia in Q3 2025.\n\n**Recommended drive-away prices (latest):** CarTell says recommended drive-away pricing for Sydney (postcode 2000) is $70,155 for the E07 RWD and $79,605 for the E07 AWD Performance, checked on deepal.com.au in August 2026.\n\n**By state (The Beep):**\n- **RWD:** Victoria $70,290, NSW $70,155, Queensland $68,524, WA $71,995, SA $69,662, Tasmania $69,736, ACT $69,820, NT $67,565\n- **AWD:** Victoria $79,668, NSW $79,605, Queensland $77,704, WA $81,610, SA $79,022, Tasmania $79,096, ACT $79,253, NT $76,835\n\n**Carsales' indicative drive-away prices:** $67,564–$71,837 for the base model and $76,834–$81,422 for the Performance.\n\n**Specs:** The RWD claims 550 km of WLTP range and charges at up to 240 kW DC. The 800V AWD Performance makes 440 kW and 645 Nm and does 0–100 km/h in a claimed 3.96 seconds. An orange interior trim costs an extra $500.\n\n**Dealer listings:** Prices vary. For example, a new 2026 E07 Performance AWD is listed at $77,704 drive-away at a dealer in Queensland. Some dealer demos are listed for less.\n\n**Sources disagree on two points:**\n- **Warranty:** The Beep lists 7 years / 160,000km, while CarTell says \"5 years, unlimited km (expected)\". CarTell also refers to Subaru Australia dealers, so its page may contain mistakes.\n- **Base price:** Evee's earlier estimate of about $68,000 drive-away for the RWD is lower than the later recommended figure of about $70,155 for Sydney.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"8e65b43e-6ece-4af3-a008-94bdb6b23838","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:16:00.379Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Deepal E07 Australia price drive-away announced","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Jc6oZVmXBoP9RZrcz