{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BwSEGGaXk4ZPeN8MynUdVQ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Leapmotor B05 Australia price WLTP range kW DC charging leapmotor.com.au\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"2026 Leapmotor B05: price, specs and release date in Australia\",\"url\":\"https://www.racv.com.au/royalauto/transport/electric-vehicles/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-release-date.html\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Review Australia 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.gridly.com.au/blog/leapmotor-b05-review-australia-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Leapmotor B05 Price and Specs: Electric Hatch from $35,990 Drive-Away\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsauce.com/news/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-australia\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Price, Specs & Variants\",\"url\":\"https://thebeep.com.au/cars/leapmotor/b05/\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Australia Price: Is This the Best Cheap EV Hatch Yet?\",\"url\":\"https://www.drive-electric.com.au/post/leapmotor-b05-australia-price-is-this-the-best-cheap-ev-hatch-yet\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 - EV Price, Range & Specs\",\"url\":\"https://evdbau.com/v/leapmotor-b05\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Style (2026 - Current): $35,888 Price & Specs\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/style\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR (2026 - Current): $39,888 Specs\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Leapmotor B05 local review\",\"url\":\"https://www.mynrma.com.au/open-road/car-reviews/leapmotor/2026-leapmotor-b05-local-review\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Leapmotor B05 review\",\"url\":\"https://www.mynrma.com.au/open-road/car-reviews/leapmotor/2026-leapmotor-b05-review\"}]\n\nThe Leapmotor B05 costs **$35,990 drive-away for the Style and $39,990 for the Design LR** (list prices $35,888 and $39,888 plus on-roads). WLTP range is **401 km and 482 km**, both grades make **160 kW**, and DC fast charging tops out at **174 kW**, though the Style's peak may be lower. None of the results came from leapmotor.com.au itself, so these figures come from third-party sites.\n\n**Price**\n- The range opens at $35,990 drive-away for the Style and $39,990 drive-away for the Design LR.\n- Before on-road costs, the Style is $35,888 and the Design LR $39,888, as of October 2026.\n- The Style's $35,990 price has conditions: Leapmotor Australia lists it in Lightning Yellow, for cars bought and delivered by 31 December 2026 or while stocks last. Other colours cost extra.\n- There was also an earlier launch offer: Design LR from $38,990 drive-away (1 July to 30 September 2026). That offer has now ended.\n- It went on sale from late August 2026.\n\n**Battery, range and power**\n- The Style uses a 56.2kWh LFP battery for up to 401km WLTP, while the Design LR steps up to a 67.1kWh LFP battery for up to 482km WLTP.\n- Both use a single rear motor producing 160kW and 240Nm, and the Design LR claims 0-100km/h in 6.7 seconds. TheBeep lists the Style at 7.5 seconds.\n- Claimed WLTP energy use is 15.8 kWh/100 km (Style) and 15.9 kWh/100 km (Design LR).\n- In NRMA's local test, the reviewers consistently matched or slightly beat the 15.9kWh/100km claim, so the 482km range claim held up.\n\n**Charging**\n- CarSauce lists 11kW AC charging, 30 to 80 per cent DC charging in about 16 minutes for the Style, DC fast charging up to 174kW, and 30 to 80 per cent in about 18 minutes for the Design LR.\n- EVDB AU gives a lower peak for the Style: 156 kW DC and 10–80% in 22 minutes, against 174 kW and 24 minutes for the Design LR.\n- NRMA and Gridly simply quote 174 kW as the maximum.\n\n**Other details**\n- It has a five-star ANCAP rating.\n- Warranty is 6 years / 150,000km.\n\n**Data warning:** Zecar's pages have the two variants' specs swapped. They show the Style with the 67.1kWh battery and 482km, and the Design LR with 56.2kWh and 401km. Every other source agrees on the figures above, so Zecar's specs shouldn't be relied on.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"68ce4963-34c1-4c76-a78e-b6b4460fb495","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:16:00.926Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Leapmotor B05 Australia price WLTP range kW DC charging leapmotor.com.au","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01A1h11DSYDiAYoupHPhQnHE","content":[{"title":"2026 Leapmotor B05: price, specs and release date in Australia","url":"https://www.racv.com.au/royalauto/transport/electric-vehicles/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-release-date.html"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Review Australia 2026","url":"https://www.gridly.com.au/blog/leapmotor-b05-review-australia-2026/"},{"title":"2026 Leapmotor B05 Price and Specs: Electric Hatch from $35,990 Drive-Away","url":"https://www.carsauce.com/news/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-australia"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Price, Specs & Variants","url":"https://thebeep.com.au/cars/leapmotor/b05/"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Australia Price: Is This the Best Cheap EV Hatch Yet?","url":"https://www.drive-electric.com.au/post/leapmotor-b05-australia-price-is-this-the-best-cheap-ev-hatch-yet"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 - EV Price, Range & Specs","url":"https://evdbau.com/v/leapmotor-b05"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Style (2026 - Current): $35,888 Price & Specs","url":"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/style"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR (2026 - Current): $39,888 Specs","url":"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr"},{"title":"2026 Leapmotor B05 local review","url":"https://www.mynrma.com.au/open-road/car-reviews/leapmotor/2026-leapmotor-b05-local-review"},{"title":"2026 Leapmotor B05 review","url":"https://www.mynrma.com.au/open-road/car-reviews/leapmotor/2026-leapmotor-b05-review"}]},"The Leapmotor B05 costs **$35,990 drive-away for the Style and $39,990 for the Design LR** (list prices $35,888