d 482km, and the Design LR with 56.2kWh and 401km. Every other source agrees on the figures above, so Zecar's specs shouldn't be relied on."],"durationSeconds":11.747070023000001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BwSEGGaXk4ZPeN8MynUdVQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
