{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PQNZgbHMeJ6gj9mWr1kDLa","type":"tool_result","content":"**Models listed on the XPENG Australia Shop page:**\n\n1. **XPENG New G6**: described as an \"Ultra Smart Coupé SUV\"\n   - Menu link: `/` (the homepage)\n   - \"Enquire Now\" link: `/pages/contact`\n   - Price: none shown\n\n2. **XPENG X9**: described as an \"Ultra Intelligent 7 Seater\"\n   - Menu link: `/pages/x9`\n   - \"Enquire Now\" link: `/pages/contact`\n   - Price: none shown\n\n**On pricing:** The page gives no vehicle prices, including for the X9. The only dollar figure is the empty cart's \"$0.00 Subtotal.\" The page directs buyers to the contact page instead of listing prices, so you would need to visit `/pages/x9` or contact XPENG for X9 pricing."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"ac53f361-bbfd-42c3-9910-ba815e0a115c","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:16:12.101Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":141913,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Models listed on the XPENG Australia Shop page:**\n\n1. **XPENG New G6**: described as an \"Ultra Smart Coupé SUV\"\n   - Menu link: `/` (the homepage)\n   - \"Enquire Now\" link: `/pages/contact`\n   - Price: none shown\n\n2. **XPENG X9**: described as an \"Ultra Intelligent 7 Seater\"\n   - Menu link: `/pages/x9`\n   - \"Enquire Now\" link: `/pages/contact`\n   - Price: none shown\n\n**On pricing:** The page gives no vehicle prices, including for the X9. The only dollar figure is the empty cart's \"$0.00 Subtotal.\" The page directs buyers to the contact page instead of listing prices, so you would need to visit `/pages/x9` or contact XPENG for X9 pricing.","durationMs":4395,"url":"https://shop.xpeng.com.au/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PQNZgbHMeJ6gj9mWr1kDLa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XgBJa2UezpmpM3hJ3ZFEnU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Leapmotor Australia official site B05 Design LR specifications\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 EV Hatchback Price and Specs for Australia\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/leapmotor-b05-ev-price-specs\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR (2026 - 2026) EV Specifications\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr\"},{\"title\":\"B05\",\"url\":\"https://www.leapmotor.net/au/b05\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Style (2026 - Current): $35,888 Price & Specs\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/style\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR 2026 review: snapshot\",\"url\":\"https://www.canberratimes.com.au/story/9379435/leapmotor-b05-design-lr-2026-review-snapshot-byd-dolphin-rival-tested/\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 - EV Price, Range & Specs\",\"url\":\"https://evdbau.com/v/leapmotor-b05\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR Charging Guide: Time, Speed, Cost & Charger Type\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/ev-charging-guides/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR 2026 Review - carsales.com.au\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/editorial/details/leapmotor-b05-design-lr-2026-review-153321/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Leapmotor B05 Price and Specs: Electric Hatch from $35,990 Drive-Away\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsauce.com/news/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-australia\"},{\"title\":\"Leapmotor B05 Design LR BEV 67.1KWH Specifications\",\"url\":\"https://www.racv.com.au/car-match/car-details/leapmotor/b05/design-lr-8529697819aa57ebde6c19cb3f19b08d0234868\"}]\n\nThe official Leapmotor Australia B05 page came up, along with several Australian reviews and spec sites. Most sources agree on the Design LR's core specs, but some numbers differ between them.\n\n**Official site (leapmotor.net/au/b05):** It lists the B05 at up to 482 km total WLTP range, approx. 18 min 30-80% DC charging, 160 kW maximum power, 4.43 m length. The Design LR adds TechnoLeather seats with OEKO-TEX, a heated steering wheel, heated front seats, a fixed panoramic glass roof with electric sunshade, electrically adjustable driver and passenger seats, a rear central armrest and cupholders, and multi-colour ambient lighting. It also gets a 12-speaker surround sound system, rain-sensing wipers, rear privacy glass and auto power-fold exterior mirrors. The same site shows the B05 at 1,880 mm wide, but it gives two boot sizes: 357/1,205 L in the headline stats and 345 litres in the FAQ.\n\n**Design LR key specs (third-party sources):**\n- **Price:** MRRP $39,888, with a $38,990 drive-away offer.\n- **Battery and range:** a 67.1kWh LFP battery with a claimed WLTP range of up to 482km.\n- **Motor:** a single rear-mounted electric motor with 160kW and 240Nm, and a claimed 0-100km/h time of 6.7 seconds. Carsales recorded 7.0 seconds in its test (we achieved 7.0 seconds).\n- **Charging:** 11kW AC, and DC fast charging at up to 174kW with a claimed 30 to 80 per cent time of about 18 minutes.\n- **Dimensions:** 4430mm long and 1880mm wide, with a 2735mm wheelbase.\n- **Seats:** six-way power driver seat and four-way power passenger seat.\n- **Warranty:** eight years/160,000km on the high-voltage battery and six years/150,000km on the vehicle.\n- **Efficiency and safety:** 15.9 kWh/100km (WLTP); five-star safety rating (2026). Drag coefficient of 0.26 and 50:50 weight distribution.\n- **Towing:** RACV lists 750kg towing capacity (braked) and $44,474 estimated VIC drive-away price.\n\n**Discrepancies:**\n- **Zecar's Design LR page has the variants swapped.** It shows the Design LR with 56.2kWh, 401km and 7.5s, which are the Style's numbers.\n- **Boot space:** sources give 345, 357, 1,205 or 1,400 L.\n- **evdbau:** it lists 6.6s for 0-100km/h and a 1912 kg weight, which don't match the other sources.\n- **Base Style for comparison:** 56.2 kWh, up to 401 km, 7.5 s 0–100 km/h, 156 kW max DC charging, approx. 16 min (30–80%).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"696e7cb9-7573-457a-803d-c55b6c7642c3","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:16:21.465Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Leapmotor Australia official site B05 Design LR specifications","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01KCuWDHfaoxXFDxXfA4a1pX","content":[{"title":"Leapmotor B05 EV Hatchback Price and Specs for Australia","url":"https://zecar.com/reviews/leapmotor-b05-ev-price-specs"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR (2026 - 2026) EV Specifications","url":"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr"},{"title":"B05","url":"https://www.leapmotor.net/au/b05"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Style (2026 - Current): $35,888 Price & Specs","url":"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/leapmotor/b05/2026/style"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR 2026 review: snapshot","url":"https://www.canberratimes.com.au/story/9379435/leapmotor-b05-design-lr-2026-review-snapshot-byd-dolphin-rival-tested/"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 - EV Price, Range & Specs","url":"https://evdbau.com/v/leapmotor-b05"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR Charging Guide: Time, Speed, Cost & Charger Type","url":"https://zecar.com/ev-charging-guides/leapmotor/b05/2026/design-lr"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR 2026 Review - carsales.com.au","url":"https://www.carsales.com.au/editorial/details/leapmotor-b05-design-lr-2026-review-153321/"},{"title":"2026 Leapmotor B05 Price and Specs: Electric Hatch from $35,990 Drive-Away","url":"https://www.carsauce.com/news/2026-leapmotor-b05-price-specs-australia"},{"title":"Leapmotor B05 Design LR BEV 67.1KWH Specifications","url":"https://www.racv.com.au/car-match/car-details/leapmotor/b05/design-lr-8529697819aa57ebde6c19cb3f19b08d0234868"}]},"The official Leapmotor Australia B05 page came up, along with several Australian reviews and spec sites. Most sources agree on the Design LR's core specs, but some numbers differ between them.\n\n**Official site (leapmotor.net/au/b05):** It lists the B05 at up to 482 km total WLTP range, approx. 18 min 30-80% DC charging, 160 kW maximum power, 4.43 m length. The Design LR adds TechnoLeather seats with OEKO-TEX, a heated steering wheel, heated front seats, a fixed panoramic glass roof with electric sunshade, electrically adjustable driver and passenger seats, a rear central armrest and cupholders, and multi-colour ambient lighting. It also gets a 12-speaker surround sound system, rain-sensing wipers, rear privacy glass and auto power-fold exterior mirrors. The same site shows the B05 at 1,880 mm wide, but it gives two boot sizes: 357/1,205 L in the headline stats and 345 litres in the FAQ.\n\n**Design LR key specs (third-party sources):**\n- **Price:** MRRP $39,888, with a $38,990 drive-away offer.\n- **Battery and range:** a 67.1kWh LFP battery with a claimed WLTP range of up to 482km.\n- **Motor:** a single rear-mounted electric motor with 160kW and 240Nm, and a claimed 0-100km/h time of 6.7 seconds. Carsales recorded 7.0 seconds in its test (we achieved 7.0 seconds).\n- **Charging:** 11kW AC, and DC fast charging at up to 174kW with a claimed 30 to 80 per cent time of about 18 minutes.\n- **Dimensions:** 4430mm long and 1880mm wide, with a 2735mm wheelbase.\n- **Seats:** six-way power driver seat and four-way power passenger seat.\n- **Warranty:** eight years/160,000km on the high-voltage battery and six years/150,000km on the vehicle.\n- **Efficiency and safety:** 15.9 kWh/100km (WLTP); five-star safety rating (2026). Drag coefficient of 0.26 and 50:50 weight distribution.\n- **Towing:** RACV lists 750kg towing capacity (braked) and $44,474 estimated VIC drive-away price.\n\n**Discrepancies:**\n- **Zecar's Design LR page has the variants swapped.** It shows the Design LR with 56.2kWh, 401km and 7.5s, which are the Style's numbers.\n- **Boot space:** sources give 345, 357, 1,205 or 1,400 L.\n- **evdbau:** it lists 6.6s for 0-100km/h and a 1912 kg weight, which don't match the other sources.\n- **Base Style for comparison:** 56.2 kWh, up to 401 km, 7.5 s 0–100 km/h, 156 kW max DC charging, approx. 16 min (30–80%)."],"durationSeconds":13.315569136000006,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XgBJa2UezpmpM3hJ3ZFEnU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
