{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1nQ3SBpVqGHmerE3BMmYh","type":"tool_result","content":"**Availability wording (exact quotes)**\n- \"Test drives are available now at your local retailer.\"\n- \"The E07 multitruck is locked, loaded, and waiting on you.\"\n- Button and menu labels: \"BOOK A TEST DRIVE\", \"Book a Test Drive\", \"Get a Quote\", \"Buying Tools\"\n- The only \"buy\" wording is in \"Buying Tools\" and \"RDP is not applicable to business or government buyers.\"\n- \"Available\" also appears in unrelated contexts: \"Optional Matte grey exterior paint & Orange Interior are available at an additional cost.\" The roadside assist note also uses it.\n- The page never uses \"on sale,\" \"order,\" \"reserve\" or \"build and price.\" The closest pricing feature is a postcode-based \"Show Price\" tool.\n\n**AC charging**\n- \"Plug in at home with 7kW AC charging — full juice in about 16 hours\"\n\n**Connector types**\n- The page doesn't name any.\n\n**Charge times**\n- \"DC Charge Time 30%-80%: 15 minutes\"\n- \"you're going from 30 to 80% in just 15 minutes** at 240kW\"\n- The page gives no 10–80% or other DC timing.\n\n**Battery**\n- \"All powered by a solid 89.98kWh NMC battery — built for distance.\"\n\n**Same battery for RWD and AWD?**\nThe page gives only one battery figure and never assigns separate capacities to each variant. That implies they share it, but it isn't stated outright. The variants do differ in range (550km for RWD, 510km for AWD).\n\nAlso note the page is inconsistent on AWD acceleration. It lists \"3.9 seconds\" in the specs and \"3.96-second\" in the power section."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"15db2c7b-3075-4e65-9c70-db49eee617db","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:18:10.815Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":230934,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Availability wording (exact quotes)**\n- \"Test drives are available now at your local retailer.\"\n- \"The E07 multitruck is locked, loaded, and waiting on you.\"\n- Button and menu labels: \"BOOK A TEST DRIVE\", \"Book a Test Drive\", \"Get a Quote\", \"Buying Tools\"\n- The only \"buy\" wording is in \"Buying Tools\" and \"RDP is not applicable to business or government buyers.\"\n- \"Available\" also appears in unrelated contexts: \"Optional Matte grey exterior paint & Orange Interior are available at an additional cost.\" The roadside assist note also uses it.\n- The page never uses \"on sale,\" \"order,\" \"reserve\" or \"build and price.\" The closest pricing feature is a postcode-based \"Show Price\" tool.\n\n**AC charging**\n- \"Plug in at home with 7kW AC charging — full juice in about 16 hours\"\n\n**Connector types**\n- The page doesn't name any.\n\n**Charge times**\n- \"DC Charge Time 30%-80%: 15 minutes\"\n- \"you're going from 30 to 80% in just 15 minutes** at 240kW\"\n- The page gives no 10–80% or other DC timing.\n\n**Battery**\n- \"All powered by a solid 89.98kWh NMC battery — built for distance.\"\n\n**Same battery for RWD and AWD?**\nThe page gives only one battery figure and never assigns separate capacities to each variant. That implies they share it, but it isn't stated outright. The variants do differ in range (550km for RWD, 510km for AWD).\n\nAlso note the page is inconsistent on AWD acceleration. It lists \"3.9 seconds\" in the specs and \"3.96-second\" in the power section.","durationMs":10243,"url":"https://www.deepal.com.au/vehicles/deepal/e07/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01B1nQ3SBpVqGHmerE3BMmYh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
