{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VCN15oyzSpi9Vu16FsT6ju","type":"tool_result","content":"# BYD Australia Model Lineup (from the homepage)\n\n**Fully electric (BEV)**\n- **ATTO 1**: labelled \"New\", tagline \"Built for the Big City\"\n- **ATTO 2**: labelled \"New\", tagline \"The Urban Explorer\"\n- **ATTO 3 Evo**: listed in the \"Find your BYD\" section\n- **ATTO 3**: listed in the menu and footer, possibly the same model as the Evo\n- **DOLPHIN**\n- **SEAL**\n- **SEALION 7**: also has a \"$4,000 Cashback\\* Offer\"\n\n**Plug-in hybrid (PHEV / DM-i)**\n- **ATTO 2 DM-i**: the new hero-banner model (\"Be the first to meet the new\"). It has a \"0.99% P.A.\" comparison rate offer or a $4,000 cashback, ending 21 December 2026.\n- **SEAL 6**\n- **SEAL 6 Touring**: a wagon variant of the Seal 6\n- **SEALION 5**: labelled \"New\"\n- **SEALION 6**\n- **SEALION 8**: labelled \"New\", described as a \"Super Hybrid 7-seat SUV\"\n- **SHARK 6**: a ute, described as \"Award-Winning Super Hybrid Ute\"\n\n**Notes**\n- The page tags most hybrids as \"PHEV\" and uses \"DM-i\" only for the ATTO 2 DM-i. It also links to a \"Dual Mode Super Hybrid\" page.\n- **eMax is not mentioned** anywhere on this page.\n- Apart from the ATTO 2 / ATTO 2 DM-i and SEAL 6 / SEAL 6 Touring, no trim-level variants are shown."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"2e0a0861-a7c5-4434-b182-8bce367fa71a","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:19:35.155Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":547206,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# BYD Australia Model Lineup (from the homepage)\n\n**Fully electric (BEV)**\n- **ATTO 1**: labelled \"New\", tagline \"Built for the Big City\"\n- **ATTO 2**: labelled \"New\", tagline \"The Urban Explorer\"\n- **ATTO 3 Evo**: listed in the \"Find your BYD\" section\n- **ATTO 3**: listed in the menu and footer, possibly the same model as the Evo\n- **DOLPHIN**\n- **SEAL**\n- **SEALION 7**: also has a \"$4,00