{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C3EhDKEevcTSzXZ35aneDf","type":"tool_result","content":"# Alfa Romeo Australia Models (per the page)\n\n**Models listed in the site navigation:**\n1. **Junior**, promoted as \"AVAILABLE NOW\"\n2. **Tonale**\n3. **Tonale Plug-In Hybrid**\n4. **Stelvio**\n5. **Giulia**\n6. **Giulia Quadrifoglio**\n\n**Other ranges mentioned:**\n- **Intensa** special series, described as \"Attractive, sporty, and unmistakably Italian\"\n- **Quadrifoglio** range, a performance line that includes the Giulia Quadrifoglio\n\n## Fully Electric Models\nThe page doesn't identify any model as fully electric. It never mentions a \"Junior Elettrica\" or any battery-electric variant. The only electrified model it names is the **Tonale Plug-In Hybrid**, which is not fully electric. The Junior image filename includes \"ibrida\" (Italian for hybrid), which points to a hybrid version rather than a pure EV.\n\n## Missing Information\nThe page gives no:\n- Variant or trim breakdowns\n- Battery capacities\n- WLTP range figures\n- DC fast-charging figures\n\nFor those specs, check the individual model pages (such as /models/junior), the brochure request, or a dealer."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"28510395-290e-46ba-90b3-c08c305ee914","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:19:45.554Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":173897,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Alfa Romeo Australia Models (per the page)\n\n**Models listed in the site navigation:**\n1. **Junior**, promoted as \"AVAILABLE NOW\"\n2. **Tonale**\n3. **Tonale Plug-In Hybrid**\n4. **Stelvio**\n5. **Giulia**\n6. **Giulia Quadrifoglio**\n\n**Other ranges mentioned:**\n- **Intensa** special series, described as \"Attractive, sporty, and unmistakably Italian\"\n- **Quadrifoglio** range, a performance line that includes the Giulia Quadrifoglio\n\n## Fully Electric Models\nThe page doesn't identify any model as fully electric. It never mentions a \"Junior Elettrica\" or any battery-electric variant. The only electrified model it names is the **Tonale Plug-In Hybrid**, which is not fully electric. The Junior image filename includes \"ibrida\" (Italian for hybrid), which points to a hybrid version rather than a pure EV.\n\n## Missing Information\nThe page gives no:\n- Variant or trim breakdowns\n- Battery capacities\n- WLTP range figures\n- DC fast-charging figures\n\nFor those specs, check the individual model pages (such as /models/junior), the brochure request, or a dealer.","durationMs":7074,"url":"https://www.alfaromeo.com.au/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01C3EhDKEevcTSzXZ35aneDf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
