{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nc74eZyeVnycwciaEFjpFS","type":"tool_result","content":"**Yes, the page offers a fully electric Junior as well as the hybrid.** It says the car is \"Available in two powertrains, hybrid (Ibrida) and electric (Elettrica).\"\n\n**Variant names**\n- \"IBRIDA\" / \"ALFA ROMEO JUNIOR IBRIDA\"\n- \"ELETTRICA\"\n- No \"Veloce\" electric version appears anywhere on the page.\n- One trim heading reads \"ALFA ROMEO IBRIDA SPECIALE,\" but the text beneath it describes the Elettrica. This looks like a labelling error.\n\n**Prices**\n- None are listed. The Ibrida section shows \"Starting from\" with no figure, and the Elettrica has no price at all.\n\n**Elettrica specs**\n- Battery: \"54kWh\"\n- Range: \"407km (WLTP)\\*\"\n- DC charging: \"100kW DC Charging,\" which takes \"approximately 27 minutes to recharge from 20% to 80%\"\n- Motor: \"115kW - 260Nm\"\n- AC charging: 11kW\n\nCharging notes carry the caveat \"Overseas model shown, Australian specification may vary.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"65820815-13d0-4bf0-b5bb-2b25bb9f7d97","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:19:52.893Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":185069,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Yes, the page offers a fully electric Junior as well as the hybrid.** It says the car is \"Available in two powertrains, hybrid (Ibrida) and electric (Elettrica).\"\n\n**Variant names**\n- \"IBRIDA\" / \"ALFA ROMEO JUNIOR IBRIDA\"\n- \"ELETTRICA\"\n- No \"Veloce\" electric version appears anywhere on the page.\n- One trim heading reads \"ALFA ROMEO IBRIDA SPECIALE,\" but the text beneath it describes the Elettrica. This looks like a labelling error.\n\n**Prices**\n- None are listed. The Ibrida section shows \"Starting from\" with no figure, and the Elettrica has no price at all.\n\n**Elettrica specs**\n- Battery: \"54kWh\"\n- Range: \"407km (WLTP)\\*\"\n- DC charging: \"100kW DC Charging,\" which takes \