{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NpeFpuepQxNY3sapVt3bDb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Chery E5 electric Australia price on sale WLTP range\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Chery E5 - EV Price, Range & Specs\",\"url\":\"https://evdbau.com/v/chery-e5\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 Price, Range & Specs Australia\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/chery/e5\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 Australia: The Budget Electric SUV Disrupting the Market - evee AU - Electric Car Rental\",\"url\":\"https://www.evee.com.au/blog/chery-e5-australia-budget-electric-suv-review/\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 Price, Specs & Variants\",\"url\":\"https://thebeep.com.au/cars/chery/e5/\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 now $37,990 driveaway as brand trims line-up to one sharp variant\",\"url\":\"https://thebeep.com.au/car-news/chery-e5-my26-price-specs-australia/\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 Review 2026: Best Price & Range\",\"url\":\"https://electriccaraustralia.com/cars/chery/e5/\"},{\"title\":\"Chery EVs - list and prices\",\"url\":\"https://evdbau.com/make/chery\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Chery E5 arrives in Australia with lower prices - Cars24\",\"url\":\"https://www.cars24.com.au/car-news/2025-chery-e5-arrives-in-australia-with-lower-prices/\"},{\"title\":\"Chery E5 Price Drop: $37,990 Driveaway MY26\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsorted.ai/blog/chery-e5-price-drop-my26-australia\"},{\"title\":\"[ Chery E5 ] Images_Specs_Price_Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://www.bitauto.com/au/chery/e5/\"}]\n\nThe Chery E5 is on sale in Australia now. It comes in one version, the Ultimate, which costs about $37,990 drive-away under the MY26 pricing. Its official WLTP range is 430 km.\n\n**Price history**\n- **2025 launch:** The car was renamed from the Omoda E5 and started from $36,990 before on-road costs. There were two versions: Urban at $36,990 and Ultimate at $40,990.\n- **MY26 (about April 2026):** Chery Australia moved the E5 to a single Ultimate variant priced from $37,990 driveaway and dropped the Urban. CarSorted says this was a $5,000 cut from the previous Ultimate price and actually cheaper than the old Urban base model was.\n- **Current drive-away by state:** TheBeep lists prices that vary by state, including $39,604 (VIC), $39,337 (NSW), $38,535 (QLD), $39,801 (WA), $37,662 (NT). It also lists an October 2026 finance offer. EVDB AU shows the Ultimate priced at $39,337 and says another variant is expected in Q4 2026, a MY27 version.\n- **Outdated listings:** Some sites, such as Zecar and ElectricCarAustralia, still show the old $36,990–$40,990 pre-on-road prices.\n\n**Range and specs**\n- All sources agree the WLTP range is **430 km**.\n- Sources disagree on battery size and charging speed:\n  - **Most sources:** 150kW and 340Nm, powered by a 61.1kWh lithium iron phosphate battery, with a top DC charging rate of 80kW.\n  - **TheBeep's MY26 article:** a 58.9kWh battery, 155kW, and a full 30-to-80 per cent DC charge taking around 30 minutes at up to 130kW.\n- Estimated real-world range is about 404 km in mixed driving and about 335 km on the highway (Zecar). Evee estimates highway range at about 320 km.\n- Other details: 0–100 km/h in 7.6 seconds, front-wheel drive, a full-size spare wheel, and a 7-year unlimited-km warranty.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3c92312-dcdc-442e-a489-64b089455724","uuid":"e3b898c9-9b28-43b2-af6b-200892e0ad5b","timestamp":"2026-11-18T12:20:29.248Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Chery E5 electric Australia price on sale WLTP range","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01W4G978wDmRMEiiE4YsXFNT","content":[{"title":"Chery E5 - EV Price, Range & Specs","url":"https://evdbau.com/v/chery-e5"},{"title":"Chery E5 Price, Range & Specs Australia","url":"https://zecar.com/electric-vehicles/chery/e5"},{"title":"Chery E5 Australia: The Budget Electric SUV Disrupting the Market - evee AU