d $36,990–$40,990 pre-on-road prices.\n\n**Range and specs**\n- All sources agree the WLTP range is **430 km**.\n- Sources disagree on battery size and charging speed:\n  - **Most sources:** 150kW and 340Nm, powered by a 61.1kWh lithium iron phosphate battery, with a top DC charging rate of 80kW.\n  - **TheBeep's MY26 article:** a 58.9kWh battery, 155kW, and a full 30-to-80 per cent DC charge taking around 30 minutes at up to 130kW.\n- Estimated real-world range is about 404 km in mixed driving and about 335 km on the highway (Zecar). Evee estimates highway range at about 320 km.\n- Other details: 0–100 km/h in 7.6 seconds, front-wheel drive, a full-size spare wheel, and a 7-year unlimited-km warranty."],"durationSeconds":10.19868550600001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NpeFpuepQxNY3sapVt3bDb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
