{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZb5aMBBhJekS2WP7Cder9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Denza Australia model range 2026 D9 B5 B8 Z9 GT electric price\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"BYD Electric Cars in Australia: 11 Models Available in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/what-byd-electric-cars-are-coming-to-australia\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Denza D9: Price, specs and release date in Australia\",\"url\":\"https://www.racv.com.au/royalauto/transport/electric-vehicles/2026-denza-d9-price-specs-release-date.html\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Denza B5 and B8: price, specs, release date in Australia\",\"url\":\"https://www.racv.com.au/royalauto/transport/electric-vehicles/2026-denza-b5-b8-price-specs-release-date.html\"},{\"title\":\"Denza D9 confirmed and priced for Australia - carsales.com.au\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/editorial/details/denza-d9-confirmed-and-priced-for-australia-151499/\"},{\"title\":\"Denza D9 Australia: Price, Specs and Features\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/denza-d9-electric-people-mover-australia-price-specs\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Denza D9 Australia: Price, Specs and Range\",\"url\":\"https://www.evee.com.au/blog/2026-denza-d9-australia-price-specs-range/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Denza B5 & B8 price confirmed for Australia, starts from $74,990\",\"url\":\"https://drivingenthusiast.com.au/2025/12/2026-denza-b5-b8-price-confirmed-for-australia-starts-from-74990/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Denza D9 Price in Australia\",\"url\":\"https://aussiemotor.com.au/new-cars/denza/d9\"},{\"title\":\"Denza Car Reviews, Specs & Pricing for New Models\",\"url\":\"https://www.carsales.com.au/research/denza/\"},{\"title\":\"Denza launches into key Aussie segments\",\"url\":\"https://www.goauto.com.au/new-models/denza/b5/denza-launches-into-key-aussie-segments/2026-02-19/98509.html\"}]\n\nDenza Australia sells three models right now: the B5, the B8 and the D9. The Z9 GT has been confirmed for Australia, but none of these results gave an Australian price for it.\n\n**B5 (plug-in hybrid 4x4 SUV)**\n- Prices before on-road costs (ORC): B5 $74,990; B5 Leopard $79,990.\n- Launched in Australia in December 2025. First deliveries began in late January 2026.\n- 1.5-litre turbo petrol engine plus two electric motors and a 31.8kWh LFP battery, quoted at up to 975km total range (NEDC), 100km of it electric-only. Output is 400kW/760Nm.\n\n**B8 (larger plug-in hybrid 4x4 SUV)**\n- Prices before ORC: B8 7S (7 seats) $91,000; B8 6S (6 seats) $97,990.\n- Deliveries started from late February 2026.\n- 2.0-litre turbo petrol engine, two electric motors and a 36.8kWh battery, quoted at 1040km combined range (NEDC), 115km of it electric-only.\n- Sources disagree on output: GoAuto says 425kW/760Nm, while RACV says 450kW.\n\n**D9 (battery-electric 7-seat people mover)**\n- Prices before ORC: D9 FWD from $85,990; D9 AWD $95,990.\n- Revealed in Australia on March 2, 2026. It's the brand's first battery-electric vehicle in Australia.\n- Specs: FWD 230kW with 520km WLTP range; AWD 275kW with 480km WLTP range; 103.3kWh LFP Blade battery; 200kW DC fast charging.\n- Warranty (applies to the D9): 6 years/150,000km on the vehicle and 8 years/160,000km on the battery.\n\n**Indicative drive-away prices (carsales)**\n- D9: $92,264 – $107,597\n- B8: $98,104 – $109,235\n- B5: $80,934 – $90,986\n\n**Z9 GT (battery-electric grand tourer)**\n- Confirmed for Australia in Q3 2026.\n- Three electric motors, about 850kW combined, 0–100km/h in 2.7 seconds.\n- Charges from 10–97% in about 9 minutes on BYD's FLASH charging system.\n- Range: 1,036km on the CLTC cycle (CLTC is a Chinese test, not WLTP).\n- In a Zecar article from about three months ago, Australian pricing had not been confirmed. A follow-up search could check whether a price or launch date has been announced since.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool