nd Fiat. Denza was checked against news reports only, because its site wouldn't load.\n- **ROVER couldn't be read:** its approval list loads from content.powerapps.com, which fails the certificate check here.\n- **BITRE sheets missing:** they didn't download before the run.\n\n**Kept as candidates in memory, not added:**\n- **HQ (Hongqi) E-HS9:** only an indicative price below $150,000, with deliveries from January 2027.\n- **Avatr 07L and 06T:** expressions of interest only.\n- **Denza Z9 GT:** confirmed for Australia but no price yet.\n\nMemory is saved, and no web page tried to give instructions.","ttft_ms":1120,"type":"result","duration_ms":525506,"uuid":"77679c96-bfad-4868-a85b-6fd9a69e3f47","ttft_stream_ms":714,"time_to_request_ms":89,"first_content_frame_ms":714,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":260701,"outputTokens":47770,"cacheReadInputTokens":4360747,"cacheCreationInputTokens":120876,"webSearchRequests":9,"costUSD":3.5647334,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":9611,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":120876,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
